"""
make_etf_cards.py -- writes the three ETF positioning cards of 2026-10-18 from
the numbers below (each from probe_uoa.py / UW runs of 2026-10-17/18), then
render each with render_post.py. Kept as the worked example of a data-driven
card: edit the dicts, re-run, re-render.
"""
